We need to find two distinct points that lie on our line. Any two points will do!\n\n- For the first point, we will let the $x$-coordinate be $x=0.$ Then the $y$-coordinate is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-4x \\\\  & =-4(0) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the first point is $(0,0).$\n\n- For the second point, we will let the $x$-coordinate be $x=1.$ Then the $y$-coordinate is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-4x \\\\  & =-4(1) \\\\  & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the second point is $(1,-4).$\n\nFinally, we plot those two points on the $xy$-plane and draw a line through them. This is the graph of $y=-4x.$ \n\n![](images/8b/8b008b94eebbd24ae51670447848ce2d644c067d43dd92d72de85b048358cc54.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["714f5f25-99f5-58fb-9ddf-b6fc9c8a48c8"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "42221fb0-f700-5e55-a7e6-33f0cb67bcb9" :answer/id #uuid "42221fb0-f700-5e55-a7e6-33f0cb67bcb9" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/8a/8a82731b726d091769fdf10ca7f5d7ee87816cd490f933aaf1fc2c19c0701603.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ad159fd3-feff-5d67-88af-d4e81768184a" :answer/id #uuid "ad159fd3-feff-5d67-88af-d4e81768184a" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/b3/b3be73566253173f2ca88649fd585cced2cab7cddc27be7c40eeae9d8db2cc09.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d3f0b6a4-03c2-5777-8ad1-670384f66a6c" :answer/id #uuid "d3f0b6a4-03c2-5777-8ad1-670384f66a6c" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/0d/0d517f4c1af2fbd48ec41131ce7dec1aeb4d2c50514e53360ab043a4daa93552.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "197e6448-d4b8-50c4-8753-532544dcd499" :answer/id #uuid "197e6448-d4b8-50c4-8753-532544dcd499" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/99/992d82dfeac6b0a73453363ca57efaa9fe70b2b5ccd7cd1712b5772f09c224d2.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4ac7786b-a678-552f-b339-f52f193863ee" :answer/id #uuid "4ac7786b-a678-552f-b339-f52f193863ee" :answer/type :a